            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মিস্ত্রি দোকান থেকে নতুন যন্ত্রাংশ আনলেন। mistri dokān theke nôtun jôntrāngshô ānlen. The mechanic brought a new part from the shop."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A careful word, common on bills and in shops that sell them."
            }
          ]
        },
