          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "যন্ত্রাংশ (jôntrāngshô) joins Sanskrit yantra, \"an instrument, a machine\", to aṃśa, \"a part, a share\" (Monier-Williams for both): a part of a machine; যন্ত্র on its own is already taught."
